# TrademarkChain API Testing
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tools

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@testAddress = 0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get All Trademarks
GET {{baseUrl}}/trademarks

### Get Trademarks with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/trademarks?category=Technology&verified=true&limit=10

### Get Single Trademark
GET {{baseUrl}}/trademarks/token_1

### Create Trademark
POST {{baseUrl}}/trademarks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tokenId": 1,
  "trademarkName": "TestBrand",
  "companyName": "Test Company Inc.",
  "creatorAddress": "{{testAddress}}",
  "registrationNumber": "TM001234",
  "ipfsHash": "QmTestHash123",
  "category": "Technology",
  "description": "Test trademark for API testing",
  "royaltyPercentage": 10,
  "transactionHash": "0xtest123"
}

### Update Trademark
PUT {{baseUrl}}/trademarks/token_1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description",
  "verified": true
}

### Verify Trademark
POST {{baseUrl}}/trademarks/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tokenId": 1,
  "companyAddress": "{{testAddress}}"
}

### Verify by Registration Number
POST {{baseUrl}}/trademarks/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registrationNumber": "TM001234"
}

### Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{testAddress}}

### Create/Update User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{testAddress}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "companyName": "Test Company Inc."
}

### Search Trademarks
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=tech&category=Technology&limit=20

### Get Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats

### Get Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Blockchain Sync - Trademark Registered
POST {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "trademark_registered",
  "data": {
    "tokenId": 1,
    "trademarkName": "TestBrand",
    "companyName": "Test Company Inc.",
    "creatorAddress": "{{testAddress}}",
    "registrationNumber": "TM001234",
    "ipfsHash": "QmTestHash123",
    "category": "Technology",
    "description": "Test trademark",
    "royaltyPercentage": 10,
    "transactionHash": "0xtest123"
  }
}

### Admin - Verify Trademark
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/verify-trademark
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trademarkId": "token_1",
  "verified": true,
  "adminAddress": "{{testAddress}}"
}

### Delete Trademark (if needed)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/trademarks/token_1